author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: The configured sync generation and package changelog check agree on real temporary trackers; Keep dependency pins and all coverage thresholds unchanged and record a behavioral revert failure
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-08T03:14:22.056Z",pi-agent,"Verified PR #8 fails only because the reusable sync generator supplies --no-pending-release to changelog:full while changelog:check retains the package release-version policy. REST update-branch refuses with a base/head conflict. Configure a caller-owned changelog:automation alias that runs the unchanged canonical generator, and verify its actual output with the existing checker on a real temporary tracker. This preserves the package policy and avoids changing the delegated changelog root cause or dependency pins."
  "2026-11-08T03:24:39.987Z",pi-agent,"The real temporary-tracker regression passes 1 of 1 and local typecheck passes. In a disposable copy, reverting only the caller post-import-script selection fails the existing changelog check, while restoring it passes 1 of 1. The exact pinned reusable workflow declares the string input and conditionally adds the differing flag only for its default changelog:full name. Node test concurrency remains capped at two. Full npm and Bun release checks will run sequentially after the focused verification."
  "2026-11-08T04:07:25.362Z",pi-agent,"The final real-tracker fixture clears inherited Git repository selection, PM-root overrides, npm user-config policy variants and Node test context before setting its isolated paths. Credential-shaped keys are removed. The refined fixture still passes 1 of 1 and typecheck passes. Product configuration, dependency pins and thresholds are unchanged."
  "2026-11-08T05:53:29.241Z",pi-agent,"Local npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass at unchanged thresholds. npm coverage suite 144/144 with 0 skipped; bun coverage suite 144/144 with 0 skipped; packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx no-git acceptance also passes 2/2 per full gate. The real temporary-tracker regression, final fixture isolation, typecheck and isolated caller-configuration revert all pass. Exact-head CI remains the full remote gate before orchestrator review."
  "2026-11-08T05:53:39.846Z",pi-agent,"Review handoff: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-http/pull/22. Final CI is visible at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-http/pull/22/checks. Local npm/Bun release gates, focused regression, typecheck and behavioral revert pass. All tracker writes are completed before final-head CI observation. Release this agent claim for orchestrator verification; the item stays in progress."
  "2026-11-14T08:51:31.227Z",codex-sweep-1114,"2026-11-14 sweep: returned idle or paused work to open; no agent is actively working this item. Delivered slices: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-http/pull/22 merged 2026-11-08T08:35:00Z; merge SHA b77b8e73ffa9c6cacab3e24668097b0e79ab7fb7; PR head d4540af99e7c38399da682ef0b12f78214e61307. Delivered: Issue-sync changelog generation agrees with release checks on real temporary trackers without changing pins or thresholds. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, test (26), CodeQL, CodeRabbit. Other check outcomes: enable-auto-merge: SKIPPED; cubic · AI code reviewer: NEUTRAL; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green). Linked PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-http/pull/8 is still OPEN; remaining: resolve and verify its outstanding acceptance before closure."
  "2026-11-14T10:07:29.801Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Release-attribution correction: completed_at = 2026-11-08T08:35:00Z from https://github.com/unbraind/pm-http/pull/22 (merge SHA b77b8e73ffa9c6cacab3e24668097b0e79ab7fb7); no fetched release tag contains that merge commit, so release remains unset and this work is genuinely unreleased."
