close_reason: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-http/pull/22 merged 2026-11-08T08:35:00Z; merge SHA b77b8e73ffa9c6cacab3e24668097b0e79ab7fb7; PR head d4540af99e7c38399da682ef0b12f78214e61307. Delivered: Issue-sync changelog generation agrees with package release checks on real temporary trackers, preserving dependency pins and all coverage thresholds with a behavioral revert proof. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, test (26), CodeQL, CodeRabbit. Other check outcomes: enable-auto-merge: SKIPPED; cubic · AI code reviewer: NEUTRAL; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green). Audit correction: linked number 8 is an open pull request, not an open GitHub issue. The merged delivery in PR 22 meets this item acceptance; the earlier sweep reopening applied the issue-only veto too broadly and is superseded."
